{"1949970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "J-Jump Arena", "steam_appid": 1949970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [2401760], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump, Predict, Outsmart!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All moves happen at once in this fast-paced, free-to-play turn-based game! <br>It’s like Rock, Paper, Scissors… on steroids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/15e6e86ca83752d92f5d6e49dd8932ec.poster.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/15e6e86ca83752d92f5d6e49dd8932ec.webm?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/15e6e86ca83752d92f5d6e49dd8932ec.mp4?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In J-Jump Arena, you’ll plan your moves, then watch the madness unfold as everyone acts at once. <strong>Chaos guaranteed.</strong> Carefully predict your opponents’ actions and outmaneuver them to stay in the game. Let's be real, though... You’ll probably blow yourself up, but that’s half the fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes to Keep You on Your Toes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/d10ec1881058423edc5e4d86a4ef0fdb.poster.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/d10ec1881058423edc5e4d86a4ef0fdb.webm?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/d10ec1881058423edc5e4d86a4ef0fdb.mp4?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a wild ride with a range of game modes! Fight to be the last one standing in chaotic <strong>Last Man Standing</strong>, or dominate the battlefield with the most kills in <strong>Deathmatch</strong>. Prove who's boss in intense <strong>1 vs 1 Duels</strong>, and keep on your toes in <strong>Disappearing Platforms</strong>, where the floor vanishes under your feet. Race to victory while blasting foes in <strong>Weapon Race</strong>. And if you're all about showing off your jumping skills, <strong>Treasure Hunt</strong>'s got you covered - out-jump your rivals and snatch up the most gems!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Mayhem with a Wild Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/dd2ddb71f74014e80cd725fa635eb0b4.avif?t=1778344505\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreak havoc with over <strong>20 weapons</strong>, each more chaotic than the last! Get inventive with the <strong>Quacknator 9001</strong>, a rubber duck that either explodes or hilariously swells up after each turn. Or freeze your enemies in their tracks with the icy <strong>Frostcore</strong>. And if you truly despise someone, nothing says revenge quite like hurling a <strong>Jar of Mosquitos</strong> right at ’em. Prefer to go old-school? The <strong>Revolver</strong>, <strong>Grenade</strong>, and <strong>Bazooka</strong> are all locked and loaded, ready to bring the destruction. Whether you're tactical or trigger-happy, there's a weapon for every style of chaos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/0bb520bb13ced704244243f4d69131a0.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From treacherous <strong>Swamps</strong> to the fiery pits of <strong>Hell</strong>, each map brings its own dangers and chaos. Want to challenge gravity? Take your fight to the low-gravity madness on the <strong>Moon</strong>! Or crawl through the ashes of civilization in the <strong>Postapocalypse</strong> arenas, where radiation is your new best mate. With even more unique locations, every arena forces you to adapt, improvise, or get left behind in the dust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/5fae45d1f6bd60db30d472429c193398.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ridiculous gear and cosmetic nonsense to make your fighter stand out... or stand out for all the wrong reasons. Either way, you’ll look glorious doing it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, easy-to-learn mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mayhem with up to 10 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode with bots for practice or casual play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes to keep things fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock items and customize your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Steam Achievements to show off your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve got the brains to survive the chaos? Prove it, sunshine.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump, Predict, Outsmart!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All moves happen at once in this fast-paced, free-to-play turn-based game! <br>It’s like Rock, Paper, Scissors… on steroids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/15e6e86ca83752d92f5d6e49dd8932ec.poster.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/15e6e86ca83752d92f5d6e49dd8932ec.webm?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/15e6e86ca83752d92f5d6e49dd8932ec.mp4?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In J-Jump Arena, you’ll plan your moves, then watch the madness unfold as everyone acts at once. <strong>Chaos guaranteed.</strong> Carefully predict your opponents’ actions and outmaneuver them to stay in the game. Let's be real, though... You’ll probably blow yourself up, but that’s half the fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes to Keep You on Your Toes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/d10ec1881058423edc5e4d86a4ef0fdb.poster.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/d10ec1881058423edc5e4d86a4ef0fdb.webm?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/d10ec1881058423edc5e4d86a4ef0fdb.mp4?t=1778344505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a wild ride with a range of game modes! Fight to be the last one standing in chaotic <strong>Last Man Standing</strong>, or dominate the battlefield with the most kills in <strong>Deathmatch</strong>. Prove who's boss in intense <strong>1 vs 1 Duels</strong>, and keep on your toes in <strong>Disappearing Platforms</strong>, where the floor vanishes under your feet. Race to victory while blasting foes in <strong>Weapon Race</strong>. And if you're all about showing off your jumping skills, <strong>Treasure Hunt</strong>'s got you covered - out-jump your rivals and snatch up the most gems!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Mayhem with a Wild Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/dd2ddb71f74014e80cd725fa635eb0b4.avif?t=1778344505\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreak havoc with over <strong>20 weapons</strong>, each more chaotic than the last! Get inventive with the <strong>Quacknator 9001</strong>, a rubber duck that either explodes or hilariously swells up after each turn. Or freeze your enemies in their tracks with the icy <strong>Frostcore</strong>. And if you truly despise someone, nothing says revenge quite like hurling a <strong>Jar of Mosquitos</strong> right at ’em. Prefer to go old-school? The <strong>Revolver</strong>, <strong>Grenade</strong>, and <strong>Bazooka</strong> are all locked and loaded, ready to bring the destruction. Whether you're tactical or trigger-happy, there's a weapon for every style of chaos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/0bb520bb13ced704244243f4d69131a0.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From treacherous <strong>Swamps</strong> to the fiery pits of <strong>Hell</strong>, each map brings its own dangers and chaos. Want to challenge gravity? Take your fight to the low-gravity madness on the <strong>Moon</strong>! Or crawl through the ashes of civilization in the <strong>Postapocalypse</strong> arenas, where radiation is your new best mate. With even more unique locations, every arena forces you to adapt, improvise, or get left behind in the dust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949970/extras/5fae45d1f6bd60db30d472429c193398.avif?t=1778344505\" width=618 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ridiculous gear and cosmetic nonsense to make your fighter stand out... or stand out for all the wrong reasons. Either way, you’ll look glorious doing it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, easy-to-learn mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mayhem with up to 10 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode with bots for practice or casual play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes to keep things fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock items and customize your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Steam Achievements to show off your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve got the brains to survive the chaos? Prove it, sunshine.</p>", "short_description": "J-Jump Arena is a free-to-play, turn-based elimination party game, in which you'll probably blow yourself up - but still have a good time doing it! Think you’ve got the brains to survive the chaos?", "supported_languages": "English, Polish, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, French, German, Italian, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic